==Description==
The '''Arctic Camo Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained from Lieutenant I rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

The '''Arctic Camo Nametag''' has text with a grey gradient and a black outline. Light grey camo background can be seen behind the text. An icon of the Lieutenant rank can be seen next to the text.

